268
00:17:26,877 --> 00:17:30,377
I have no idea. Honestly, I was busy trying to get away from you.

269
00:17:32,157 --> 00:17:35,897
So, Ace, will you tell me what she said to you?

270
00:17:35,897 --> 00:17:43,857
She said that my brother is here.

271
00:17:43,857 --> 00:17:49,817
Huh? You mean Luffy? The one with the straw hat that you're always talking about? That fool!

272
00:17:49,817 --> 00:18:03,857
Oh, man! When the heck did I start going upstairs? I want to go downstairs!

273
00:18:04,417 --> 00:18:08,277
Well, if it started going up, it'll probably go back down again sooner or later.

274
00:18:08,617 --> 00:18:09,617
I'm getting hungry.

275
00:18:09,617 --> 00:18:13,197
I've got an image of him, and it appears he's about to enter District C.

276
00:18:15,317 --> 00:18:16,737
Right. We'll see him.

277
00:18:16,737 --> 00:18:31,317
They're using Sea Prism Stone Nuts again.

278
00:18:35,937 --> 00:18:38,857
Close one!

279
00:18:38,857 --> 00:18:49,017
Oh, crap! It's that lion thing!

280
00:18:54,697 --> 00:18:56,517
Hey! Let him go!

281
00:18:56,517 --> 00:19:09,817
Need a hand, pal?

282
00:19:11,817 --> 00:19:13,557
Hey! Zoro!

283
00:19:21,557 --> 00:19:23,897
Ha-ha! Fooled ya!

284
00:19:23,897 --> 00:19:49,977
That is not Zoro, but he does sound familiar.

285
00:19:51,917 --> 00:19:53,677
Been a while, Straw Boy?

286
00:19:53,677 --> 00:19:55,597
Did you miss me, old pal?

287
00:20:00,037 --> 00:20:02,597
And try to open the plume.

288
00:20:03,237 --> 00:20:06,597
Well, did everyone enjoy my very special secret talent?

289
00:20:06,957 --> 00:20:07,917
Oh, yeah!

290
00:20:08,717 --> 00:20:10,317
It's meant to be true!

291
00:20:10,877 --> 00:20:12,917
Running now would go against everything

292
00:20:12,917 --> 00:20:14,397
Port Clay stands for.

293
00:20:14,717 --> 00:20:17,437
If we abandon allies who are risking their lives

294
00:20:17,437 --> 00:20:18,437
to pick up a friend,

295
00:20:18,437 --> 00:20:20,877
could we live ourselves tomorrow?

296
00:20:20,877 --> 00:20:24,037
Oh, Miss Hina, the enemy ships are splitting up.

297
00:20:24,997 --> 00:20:27,037
You must be feeling pretty stupid right now

298
00:20:27,037 --> 00:20:28,317
valling for such a simple trick.

299
00:20:28,677 --> 00:20:30,857
See, we're masters of disguise.

300
00:20:32,677 --> 00:20:35,817
As well as friends to the Straw Hats.

301
00:20:37,717 --> 00:20:39,217
Bring it on, sister.

302
00:20:39,357 --> 00:20:41,837
I promise you, Port Clay,

303
00:20:42,337 --> 00:20:44,797
we will never forget you.

304
00:20:46,797 --> 00:20:47,837
It's Bon!

305
00:20:47,837 --> 00:20:50,677
I'd still rather have Zorro,

306
00:20:50,837 --> 00:20:53,357
but I'm glad you're alive after all that happened!

307
00:20:54,197 --> 00:20:56,437
Tiki, open fire on Straw Hat!

308
00:20:56,797 --> 00:20:57,517
Piss off!

309
00:21:00,917 --> 00:21:01,477
Bastards!

310
00:21:01,637 --> 00:21:03,157
You stay away from my friend,

311
00:21:03,217 --> 00:21:05,397
or things are about to get fed up!

312
00:21:09,597 --> 00:21:10,897
Good boy, Sphinx.

313
00:21:11,037 --> 00:21:12,677
Now, take them out.

314
00:21:12,677 --> 00:21:13,677
There!

315
00:21:13,677 --> 00:21:14,837
After a beating like that,

316
00:21:14,837 --> 00:21:15,837
he shouldn't be bothering us anymore.

317
00:21:15,837 --> 00:21:17,837
Sometimes, when you're dealing with an animal,

318
00:21:17,837 --> 00:21:19,837
you have to teach it the law of the jungle.

319
00:21:19,837 --> 00:21:21,837
Fried noodles.

320
00:21:21,837 --> 00:21:22,837
You really bailed us out last time,

321
00:21:22,837 --> 00:21:23,837
but I thought for sure you were dead!

322
00:21:23,837 --> 00:21:25,837
Am I ever happy to see you!

323
00:21:25,837 --> 00:21:27,837
Ha ha ha ha ha ha!

324
00:21:27,837 --> 00:21:28,837
Oh, stop pulling my tail!

325
00:21:28,837 --> 00:21:30,997
You know swans never die!

326
00:21:30,997 --> 00:21:32,957
Unless that isn't true!

327
00:21:33,117 --> 00:21:48,217
Ha ha ha ha!

328
00:21:48,217 --> 00:21:56,297
And now a reminder of how Bon Clay's power works.

329
00:21:56,797 --> 00:21:58,137
He ate the clone clone fruit,

330
00:21:58,537 --> 00:22:00,297
allowing him to transform into anyone

331
00:22:00,297 --> 00:22:02,177
whose face is touched with his right hand.

332
00:22:02,657 --> 00:22:03,957
He was able to turn into Zorro

333
00:22:03,957 --> 00:22:05,537
because he had touched him before,

334
00:22:05,877 --> 00:22:07,957
but he is not able to mimic his strength.

335
00:22:11,897 --> 00:22:14,497
Now there's another escapee to deal with.

336
00:22:14,637 --> 00:22:16,257
The deeper the straw hat descends,

337
00:22:16,257 --> 00:22:18,677
the more frenzy seems to pick up along the way.

338
00:22:21,937 --> 00:22:23,957
Lugari, I don't care what it takes.

339
00:22:24,077 --> 00:22:25,237
Don't let them escape.

340
00:22:30,057 --> 00:22:35,417
Oh, and by the way,

341
00:22:35,757 --> 00:22:38,997
I heard that you wanted to go all the way down to level five.

342
00:22:39,177 --> 00:22:41,897
That's the plan, but I can use a guide if you're not too busy.

343
00:22:42,277 --> 00:22:44,017
Wouldn't have it any other way, my friend.

344
00:22:44,017 --> 00:22:46,837
As fate would have it, there's someone down on level five

345
00:22:46,837 --> 00:22:48,057
I'd like to see, too.

346
00:22:48,817 --> 00:22:49,337
Really?

347
00:22:50,877 --> 00:22:53,017
Now then, shall we go?

348
00:22:54,317 --> 00:22:55,897
Let's do it!

349
00:22:55,897 --> 00:23:07,517
Teaming up with Bon Clay,

350
00:23:07,777 --> 00:23:10,137
Luffy races from level three to level four,

351
00:23:10,457 --> 00:23:13,757
pummeling every blue goodie that dares to stand in their path.

352
00:23:13,897 --> 00:23:15,837
But all good things must come to an end,

353
00:23:15,837 --> 00:23:18,157
and the powerful demon guard Minotaurus

354
00:23:18,157 --> 00:23:20,057
is ready to do some pummeling of his own.

355
00:23:20,057 --> 00:23:22,077
On the next One Piece,

356
00:23:22,377 --> 00:23:23,797
Warden Magellan's strategy,

357
00:23:24,117 --> 00:23:25,897
straw hat entrapment completed,

358
00:23:26,357 --> 00:23:28,077
I'm going to be king of the pirates!

